   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to promote the resilience of young people and their families through the reconstruction of educational opportunities with protective components in Northern Syria. The project consists of the following components. 1) Vocational training for young people (an estimated 30% of which is female)2) Psycho-social support for young people as well as case counselling and referral</narrative>
